+## 3. RAY-EDGE and the Chamber-II Polynomial
+
+`RAY:276-282` identifies the boundary inhomogeneity with HF's chamber-II
+polynomial
+
+```text
+P(c) = 4e^2(2e-1) + 4ce(2e-1) - c^2(6e+1)
+rho = -P(-(2e+1)) * b^2 eta_e^4 / ((4e-2) s_sigma^2).
