+## 5. RAY-2 and the Pins
+
+For survivors `U >= 3e+2`, the displayed system has `rho=0`.  Solving only
+`N1=N3=0` gives
+
+```text
+alpha = beta - delta/2
+gamma = beta + delta/2
+```
