+coefficients:
+  alpha: 0
+  beta:  0
+  gamma: 0
+  delta: 0
+  rho:   0
+constant: 0
+```
+
+Coefficient-by-coefficient, before simplification:
+
+```text
+alpha:  n - n = 0
+beta:  -n + (n-2) + 2 = 0
+gamma: -(n-2) + (n-2) = 0
+delta:  n/2 + (n-2)/2 - (n-1) = 0
+rho:   -(n-2) + (n-2) = 0       after moving the RHS to the left
+```
