+EQ1: 0
+EQ2: 0
+EQ3: 0
+EQ4: 0
+E0:  0
+```
+
+For the `mu` scaling, the only p'-weight that makes all five residuals vanish
+is the one printed in RAY:
+
+```text
+eta -> mu eta, s -> mu^2 s, q -> mu^3 q, r -> mu^2 r,
+G -> mu^2 G, p' -> mu^3 p', kappa -> mu^5 kappa
+
